{
  "dashboard_name": "Project Management Dashboard Template",
  "source": "analytics",
  "report": "# Project Management Dashboard\n\n## Overview\nThis dashboard gives Template delivery leaders a portfolio-level view of project health, task throughput, and execution cadence. It supports PMs, engineering managers, and delivery leads in catching slipping milestones, blocked work, and overloaded owners.\n\n## Key Metrics\n- Active Projects: 8\n- Pending Projects: 3\n- New Tasks: 36\n- In Progress Tasks: 25\n- Resolved Tasks: 162\n- Overdue Tasks: 14\n\n## Insights\n- Two high-priority projects are trending toward milestone slippage in Q2\n- Task priority distribution is skewed toward High and Low — Normal tasks are underrepresented, suggesting triage inconsistency\n- Throughput is steady week-over-week; cycle time has tightened by 6% this quarter",
  "widgets": [
    {
      "type": "number",
      "name": "Active Projects",
      "calculation": {
        "datasets": [
          {"name": "Active Projects", "data_source": "projects", "module": "Project Management", "operation": "count", "filters": {"status": "Active"}}
        ],
        "expected_value": "8"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "number",
      "name": "Pending Projects",
      "calculation": {
        "datasets": [
          {"name": "Pending Projects", "data_source": "projects", "module": "Project Management", "operation": "count", "filters": {"status": "Pending"}}
        ],
        "expected_value": "3"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "number",
      "name": "New Tasks",
      "calculation": {
        "datasets": [
          {"name": "New Tasks", "data_source": "tasks", "module": "Project Management", "operation": "count", "filters": {"status": "new"}}
        ],
        "expected_value": "36"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "number",
      "name": "In Progress",
      "calculation": {
        "datasets": [
          {"name": "In Progress Tasks", "data_source": "tasks", "module": "Project Management", "operation": "count", "filters": {"status": "in_progress"}}
        ],
        "expected_value": "25"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "number",
      "name": "Resolved Tasks",
      "calculation": {
        "datasets": [
          {"name": "Resolved Tasks", "data_source": "tasks", "module": "Project Management", "operation": "count", "filters": {"status": "resolved"}}
        ],
        "expected_value": "162"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "bar",
      "title": "Tasks per Status",
      "description": "Workflow state distribution across active tasks — surfaces WIP imbalance.",
      "data_config": {
        "module": "Project Management",
        "data_source": "tasks",
        "group_by": ["status"],
        "fields": ["open", "in_progress", "for_deployment", "for_fe_integration", "new", "on_hold", "reopened", "resolved"],
        "aggregation": "count"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "bar",
      "title": "Tasks per Priority",
      "description": "Priority mix across active tasks. Helps detect triage drift.",
      "data_config": {
        "module": "Project Management",
        "data_source": "tasks",
        "group_by": ["priority"],
        "fields": ["critical", "high", "normal", "low", "very_low"],
        "aggregation": "count"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "pie",
      "title": "Project per Priority",
      "description": "Portfolio priority distribution across active projects.",
      "data_config": {
        "module": "Project Management",
        "data_source": "projects",
        "group_by": ["priority"],
        "fields": ["Critical", "High", "Normal", "Low", "Very Low"],
        "aggregation": "count"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "title": "Milestone Trend",
      "description": "Milestones completed versus planned per month over the last 12 months.",
      "data_config": {
        "module": "Project Management",
        "data_source": "milestones",
        "group_by": ["custom_dates"],
        "date_from": null,
        "date_to": null,
        "date_interval": "monthly",
        "aggregation": "count"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "name": "Project per Status",
      "description": "All projects with client, start/end dates, and current status.",
      "data_config": {
        "module": "Project Management",
        "data_source": "projects",
        "group_by": ["title", "client", "start_date", "end_date", "status"]
      },
      "column_count": 5,
      "column_width": 160
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "name": "Upcoming Milestones",
      "description": "Next milestones by due date with current risk status.",
      "data_config": {
        "module": "Project Management",
        "data_source": "milestones",
        "group_by": ["title", "project_id", "due_date", "status"]
      },
      "column_count": 4,
      "column_width": 180
    }
  ]
}
